    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36899" root="كرفأ" body-key="k">
    
      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْفَأَتِ القِدْرُ</span></b>  <i>The pot frothed,</i> or
<i>raised a scum, when about to boil.</i> (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْفَأَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْفَأَةٌ</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرفأ</span></b> ; (like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كرثأ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرثأ</span>, K, which are said to be changed
from the former; TA;) <i>It</i> (a collection of
clouds) <i>became large in quantity, and confused,
and heaped up.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْفَؤُوا</span> <i>They became
mixed together.</i> (K.)

